title: "Task–Action CallingGraph Structural Delta Intelligence and Growth"

type: software

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-09-09"

authors:
  - family-names: "Tan"
    given-names: "Sizhe"

abstract: >-
  TACG-SDIG develops a structural AI coding framework centered on Structural
  Delta Intelligence. The framework represents Task and Action CallingGraphs,
  localizes known structural neighborhoods, applies Graph Minus to isolate
  meaningful Task-side and Action-side deltas, performs two-way Delta Search,
  reconstructs candidate changes, validates reachability, feasibility, policy,
  security, and counter-evidence, and folds validated outcomes back into
  structural memory. The repository further develops Delta Memory, Task–Action
  Delta Pairs, Delta CCC/DNA structures, structural evolution trajectories,
  and Delta-Scoped Structural Governance for AI coding.

